      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Xibalba Codex? The sky-watchers of old used a certain code when they wrote their codices, to keep their knowledge secret.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_38.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The need for secrets has long passed. The Ciphers were kept in one of the Estates in the Cenote... that is where you must go.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_39.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Find the Ciphers to the Xibalba Codex and return it to me, and we will decipher the secrets of Xibalba.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_40.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I will tell you exactly where to find the Ciphers. I hope they have not been taken by the Hungry Dead!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_41.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "With the Ciphers, we can now read more of the Xibalba Codex. The ancient scholars wrote much about it...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_42.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>The sky now watches Azteca with a Sparking Eye. The eye of the dread Xibalba, the Place of Fear. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_43.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>This is the end of the cycle, the time beyond time. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_44.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>What can blind the Sparking Eye of the heavens? What can defeat the Place of Fear? What can slay Xibalba? </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_45.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AZ-ZOCOLO-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "At any rate, there is much to read here. Please tell Tezcat what we have discovered!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Parasaur_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_AZT|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZaylinReedwalker_AZT_46.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 643255,
